==> My approach:
--Find the middle value in the sorted LAT_N
SELECT DISTINCT CAST(
        PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY LAT_N) OVER()
        AS DECIMAL(18, 4)
    )
    AS median
FROM STATION ;
